### Create Customer
POST http://localhost:8080/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Charlie",
  "email": "charlie@example.com"
}

###

### Create Product 1
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "price": 1000
}

###

### Create Product 2
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse",
  "price": 50
}

###

### Get Product
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1

###

### Get Products
GET http://localhost:8080/products?page=0&size=10

###

### Get Products Sorted
GET http://localhost:8080/products?page=0&size=10&sort=price,asc

###

### Search by Name
GET http://localhost:8080/products/search?name=laptop&page=0&size=10

###

### Specification - Name
GET http://localhost:8080/products/search-spec?name=laptop&page=0&size=10

###

### Specification - Minimum Price
GET http://localhost:8080/products/search-spec?minPrice=500&page=0&size=10

###

### Specification - All Filters
GET http://localhost:8080/products/search-spec?name=laptop&minPrice=500&maxPrice=1500&page=0&size=10&sort=price,asc

###

### Get Product Before Dirty Checking
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1

###

### Update Price Using Dirty Checking
PUT http://localhost:8080/products/1/price/dirty-checking?price=1200

###

### Get Product After Dirty Checking
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1

###

### Normal Product Update
PUT http://localhost:8080/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Updated",
  "price": 1300
}

###

### Create Order
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

### Get Order
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/1

###

### Get Orders
GET http://localhost:8080/orders

###

### Get Order Items
GET http://localhost:8080/order-items

###

### Get Order Item
GET http://localhost:8080/order-items/1

###

### Remove Item from Order
DELETE http://localhost:8080/orders/1/items/1

###

### Get Order After Removing Item
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/1

